alog & SPSS syntax |\n| Analyze > Dimension Reduction > Factor | `stat.factor` | Done | Factor Analysis / PCA (Principal Components), KMO and Bartlett's test of sphericity, Communalities (Initial & Extraction), Total Variance Explained, Component Matrix, DialogKit dialog & authentic SPSS tables, SPSS FACTOR syntax |\n| Analyze > Survival > Life Tables | `stat.survival.lifetables` | Done | Actuarial life tables analysis, intervals, entry/withdrawn/exposed cases, terminal events, proportion terminating (q), cumulative survival (P), hazard rate, DialogKit dialog, SPSS SURVIVAL syntax |\n| Analyze > Survival > Kaplan-Meier | `stat.survival.km` | Done | Kaplan-Meier product-limit survival estimation, cumulative survival S(t), Greenwood standard errors, mean & median survival with 95% CI, Mantel-Cox Log-Rank test, DialogKit dialog, authentic SPSS Pivot Tables, SPSS KM syntax |\n| Analyze > Survival > Cox Regression | `stat.survival.cox` | Done | Cox Proportional Hazards Regression (Newton-Raphson partial likelihood, Breslow & Efron tie handling, stratification support, -2LL omnibus tests, B, SE, Wald, Exp(B) with 95% CI, Breslow baseline hazard & survival at covariate means, vector step plot), DialogKit dialog, 4 authentic SPSS Pivot Tables, SPSS COXREG syntax |"
